+
+- The five-team pilot is a controlled product-validation cohort, not a general launch.
+- A facilitator is the accountable operator for a meeting's action items; team members are recipients/owners, not autonomous agents.
+- Reminder channel and commercial model remain deliberately undecided until the pilot establishes the core workflow's value.
