+
+### Key Stakeholders
+
+| Role | Name/Team | Interest | Influence |
+|------|-----------|----------|-----------|
+| Pilot sponsor | To be named | Evidence that the five-team pilot reduces accountability failures | High |
+| Facilitator representatives | One or more pilot facilitators, to be named | A fast, trustworthy meeting-close workflow | High |
